[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0123","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2610","title":"Opera 浏览器 未明远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器 11.50 之前版本中存在一个未明确说明的严重漏洞，被官方描述为\"中等严重问题\"。该漏洞允许远程攻击者通过未知攻击向量完全破坏目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，无需任何身份认证。由于厂商未公开具体技术细节，该漏洞的具体触发机制和利用方式尚不明确，但 CVSS v2 评分为 10.0（满分），表明其潜在危害极大。Opera 公司在 11.50 版本中修复了此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2610"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:38Z","remediation":"升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本，该版本已修复此未明漏洞。用户可通过 Opera 内置自动更新功能或访问官网下载最新版本进行更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2610","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2610.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2610.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2011/CVE-2011-2610.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0123.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0122","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2609","title":"Opera Opera 浏览器 data:URI 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器 11.50 之前版本未正确限制 data: URI 的使用，存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意网站，诱使用户访问后利用 data: URI 在目标浏览器上下文中注入并执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击需用户交互（点击链接），影响使用 Opera 11.50 之前版本的所有系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2609"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:38Z","remediation":"升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本。Opera 11.50 修复了 data: URI 处理不当导致的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法立即升级，可配置浏览器禁用 data: URI 的脚本执行权限，或使用 NoScript 类扩展限制不可信站点的脚本运行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/45060","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","http://www.opera.com/support/kb/view/995/","http://www.osvdb.org/73485","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48500","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68322","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2609","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2609.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2609.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2011/CVE-2011-2609.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0064","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-1337","title":"Opera Opera浏览器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera浏览器在11.50之前版本中存在拒绝服务漏洞。原理上，当用户访问大量无效URL时，浏览器会为每个无效URL生成错误页面并写入磁盘，导致磁盘空间被迅速耗尽，最终造成浏览器崩溃。攻击条件为远程攻击者诱导用户访问大量精心构造的无效URL即可触发该漏洞，无需身份认证。该漏洞影响Opera 11.50之前的所有版本，CVSS评分4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1337"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:29:10Z","remediation":"升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本。访问 https://www.opera.com 下载最新版本安装。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或代理层面限制对不可信 URL 的访问，并定期清理浏览器错误页面缓存目录以缓解磁盘空间耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN47757122/index.html","http://jvndb.jvn.jp/ja/contents/2011/JVNDB-2011-000049.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45060","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","http://www.opera.com/support/kb/view/996/","http://www.osvdb.org/73486","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48501","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68323","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-1337","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-13xx/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2011-1337.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1337.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2011/CVE-2011-1337.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0121","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2605","title":"Mozilla Firefox和Thunderbird CRLF注入漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.6.18之前版本及4.x至4.0.1版本、Thunderbird 3.1.11之前版本的nsCookieService::SetCookieStringInternal函数中存在CRLF注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在JavaScript的document.cookie表达式中注入包含换行符（\\n）的恶意字符串，绕过预期的访问限制，向Cookie中注入任意内容，进而可能配合其他攻击手段实现会话劫持或信息篡改。该漏洞利用需要用户交互（如访问恶意网站），CVSS评分4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2605"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:38Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 3.6.18 或 4.0.2 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.11 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，降低 CRLF 注入攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-19.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=643051","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14401","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2605.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2605.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2605","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2605","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2605","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2605","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2605.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2605.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2605","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/e7393e4662b98c582439177871aa2228c548d9c4/tracker/CVE/2011/CVE-2011-2605.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0093","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2377","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey multipart/x-mixed-replace图像内存损坏漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Mozilla Firefox（4.0.1 及更早版本）、Thunderbird（3.1.11 及更早版本）及 SeaMonkey（2.0.14 及更早版本）中，由于浏览器引擎在解析 multipart/x-mixed-replace 类型图像时存在内存损坏缺陷。攻击者可构造恶意网页，当用户访问时触发该漏洞，导致应用程序崩溃或内存破坏，在特定条件下可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需用户认证，仅需用户访问恶意页面即可触发，攻击复杂度低，主要影响客户端安全。Mozilla 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 Firefox 3.6.18 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2377"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:13Z","remediation":"将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 3.6.18 或更高版本（3.6.x 分支），或升级至 4.0.1 及以上版本；将 Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.11 或更高版本；将 SeaMonkey 升级至 2.0.14 或更高版本。Linux 用户可通过系统包管理器执行更新命令（如 Ubuntu/Debian 使用 sudo apt-get upgrade thunderbird firefox seamonkey），Windows 用户通过 Firefox/Thunderbird 内置更新功能或官网下载最新安装包覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，可禁用浏览器中 multipart/x-mixed-replace 图片加载功能，或在邮件客户端中关闭自动加载远程图片作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-21.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=638018","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=639303","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13872","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2377.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02