cker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2376","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-2376"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0091","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2374","title":"Mozilla Firefox 浏览器引擎内存破坏漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 及 Thunderbird 的浏览器引擎中存在多处未指定的内存安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过未知向量触发内存破坏，导致应用程序崩溃或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Firefox 3.6.18 之前版本及 4.x 至 4.0.1 版本、Thunderbird 3.1.11 之前版本，攻击无需身份认证且无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Mozilla 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2374"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:12Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 3.6.18 或 5.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.11 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用 JavaScript 并关闭 XUL 文档支持作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-19.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=626262","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=629858","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=639648","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=642338","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=642734","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=643051","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=645572","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=646662","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68128","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14123","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2374.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2605.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2374.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2374","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2374","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2374","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2374","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2374.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2374.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2374"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0090","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2373","title":"Mozilla Firefox XUL文档释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 在解析 XUL 文档时存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当用户禁用 JavaScript 的情况下，攻击者可通过构造特制的 XUL 文档触发已释放内存的访问，导致浏览器崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Firefox 3.6.18 之前版本及 4.x 至 4.0.1、Thunderbird 3.1.11 之前版本、SeaMonkey 2.0.14 之前版本。攻击者需要诱导用户访问恶意页面，利用难度较高（需禁用 JS），但成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。Mozilla 已在 2011 年 6 月的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2373"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:12Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 3.6.18 及以上版本（或 4.0.2+），Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.11 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.0.15 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中启用 JavaScript（禁用 JavaScript 是触发条件之一）并禁用 XUL 文档执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-20.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=617247","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68133","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14178","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2373.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2373.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2373","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/3