E/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0086.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0085","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2363","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey SVG 元素列表释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 的 SVG 元素列表实现中存在释放后使用漏洞，具体位于 nsSVGPointList::AppendElement 函数中。当处理用户提供的回调函数时，程序未能正确管理内存对象的生命周期，导致已释放的内存指针被继续使用。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 SVG 文档，诱使用户访问恶意页面触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，或在受影响的系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Firefox 3.6.18 之前版本、Thunderbird 3.1.11 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.0.14 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2363"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:11Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 3.6.18 或更高版本，升级 Thunderbird 至 3.1.11 或更高版本，升级 SeaMonkey 至 2.1 或更高版本。无法升级的用户可采取禁用 JavaScript 或限制 SVG 渲染作为临时缓解措施。相关补丁已包含在 Mozilla 安全公告 MFSA 2011-23 中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-23.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=648160","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14046","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2363.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/bl