config 中禁用第三方 Cookie 作为临时缓解措施，或配置代理层对 Set-Cookie 响应头中的域名进行规范化校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-24.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=616264","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13693","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-2362.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2362.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2362","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2362","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2362","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2362","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2362.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2362.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-2362","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2362"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0028","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0085","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey XUL文档处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.6.18 之前版本、Thunderbird 3.1.11 之前版本及 SeaMonkey 2.0.14 及之前版本中的 nsXULCommandDispatcher 函数存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 XUL 文档，在脚本禁用状态下触发命令更新器出队操作，导致已释放的内存被重新访问，从而执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击无需身份认证且复杂度低，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0085"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:46Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 3.6.18 及以上版本，Thunderbird 至 3.1.11 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 至 2.0.14 以上版本。Debian 用户安装 DSA-2268-1（iceweasel 3.5.16-8）、DSA-2269-1（iceape 2.0.11-6）、DSA-2273-3（icedove 3.0.11-1+squeeze3）。临时缓解措施：在浏览器中禁用 XUL 脚本执行（设置 xpinstall.whitelist.required 为 true）或使用不受影响的 Firefox 4+/SeaMonkey 2.1+。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-23.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=648100","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14432","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-0085.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0085.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-0085","https://github.com/mozilla/foundation-security-advisories/blob/3b3c634b70342ed22f06614c696b3ad8867239e1/announce/2011/mfsa2011-23.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/75b5e380a041f7d82baaaae75856fe8702a1ff30/2011/CVE-2011-0085.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mvwq-v22m-89qj/GHSA-mvwq-v22m-89qj.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-0085","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/deb_2269_1.nasl","https://github.com/SySeVR/SySeVR/blob/db9ceaf351185b281c45bfb95f221b5fe741f928/Implementation/source2slice/extract_df.py","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4b0d8bed909a9e73488ee72b609c0994ae32f30/tracker/CVE/2011/CVE-2011-0085.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0026","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0083","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey SVG元素列表释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.6.18之前版本、Thunderbird 3.1.11之前版本及SeaMonkey 2.0.14及之前版本的SVG元素列表实现中存在释放后使用漏洞，具体位于nsSVGPathSegList::ReplaceItem函数中。远程攻击者可利用用户提供的回调函数，通过特制的SVG内容触发已释放内存的访问，导致应用程序崩溃或可能执行任意代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS评分10.0，危害等级严重。用户需升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0083"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T16:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:46Z","remediation":"将 Firefox 升级至 3.6.18 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.11 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.1 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 和 SVG 支持作为临时缓解措施，或使用 Firefox 4+/SeaMonkey 2.1+ 等不受影响版本替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-07/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/45002","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100144854","http://support.avaya.com/css/P8/documents/100145333","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2268","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2269","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2273","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:111","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-23.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0885.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0886.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0887.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0888.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1149-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=648090","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13543","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-0083.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0083.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-0083","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2011.txt","https://github.com/mozilla/foundation-security-advisories/blob/3b3c634b70342ed22f066